    ontoksd:hasTaskStatement "Read a valid nonnegative fractional catch weight P. Under the exercise rule of 50 kilograms and R$4.00 per excess kilogram, set E = P - 50 and M = 4 * E only when P > 50; otherwise assign zero to both."@en ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/eduknowgpt/OCSP/blob/main/CSP/cycles/cycle-04/en/TASK409-ExcessFishingWeight/TASK409-CSP-Report.md>,
